    text+='Over104/226 (46.02%), Under90/160 (56.25%). Receptions lead original combined selections54/94 (57.45%); interceptions lead original Overs6/10 (60.00%); receiving yards lead original Unders13/20 (65.00%). These are different selected pools, not a universal side/category advantage. The all-category game-cluster sensitivity interval is43.49%–57.61%, with only one exposed week and no independent week interval or selection-adjusted claim.\n\n'
    text+='The earliest qualified saved top list contains23 picks (11Over+12Under), not a top12combined list. It has8/17 decided wins (47.06%),6pending. All original, later list and losing versions remain. No prices/book rules are authenticated: all results below are **statistical threshold crossings**, not verified sportsbook settlement, profitability or EV. No model was fitted, called for inference or issued a new forecast in this checkpoint.\n\n'
