    text+=table(['Category','Selected O/U','Over W–L / decided (rate)','Under W–L / decided (rate)','Combined W–L / decided (rate)','Pending / participation unknown','Eligible offers / selection coverage'],[[r['target'],f"{r['over_selected']}/{r['under_selected']}",result(r,'over'),result(r,'under'),result(r,'combined'),f"{r['pending']}/{r['unknown']}",f"{r['eligible']} / {pct(r['coverage'])}"]for r in sorted(original,key=lambda r:scoring.TARGETS.index(r['target']))])
    text+='Chart-PPR and rushing-or-receiving anytimeTD: **N/A—no compatible retained provider-labelled threshold/selection contract**. A category with zero decided records is N/A, never0%. Main mask/source rows: [original scores](original-v1/SCORES.json), [side CSV](original-v1/SIDE_TABLE.csv), [game finality](original-v1/GAME_COVERAGE.json), [source assignments](FROZEN_SOURCE_ASSIGNMENTS_V1.json), [independent source/grade review](independent/INITIAL_ORIGINAL_WEEK8_INDEPENDENT_REVIEW_V1.json).\n\n'
    text+='## Table B — actual saved top picks\n\n'
    text+='Primary is the earliest qualified fixed Week8 list, digest`dd1ae366…`, retainedOctober27, chosen by the pre-label timing convention. It has11Overs+12Unders; no slots are manufactured. The same original source board has21/50 correct all-leans (42.00%),11pending, versus the top list8/17 (47.06%),6pending. This is nested selection-pool performance, not a learner effect or a statistically established top-list benefit. Comparing the top list with the different rolling T90 all-leans record would mix clocks.\n\n'
    text+=table(['Category','Selected O/U','Over W–L / decided (rate)','Under W–L / decided (rate)','Combined W–L / decided (rate)','Pending / unknown'],[[r['target'],f"{r['over_selected']}/{r['under_selected']}",result(r,'over'),result(r,'under'),result(r,'combined'),f"{r['pending']}/{r['unknown']}"]for r in sorted(top,key=lambda r:scoring.TARGETS.index(r['target']))])
    versions=[]
    for v in census['versions']:
        rr=[r for r in sides if r['panel']==v['panel']];ow=sum(r['over_wins']for r in rr);ol=sum(r['over_losses']for r in rr);uw=sum(r['under_wins']for r in rr);ul=sum(r['under_losses']for r in rr);n=ow+ol+uw+ul
        versions.append([v['packet_sha256'][:12],v['prepared_at'],str(v['selected_by_side']),f'{ow}/{ow+ol} {pct(ow/(ow+ol)if ow+ol else None)}',f'{uw}/{uw+ul} {pct(uw/(uw+ul)if uw+ul else None)}',f'{ow+uw}/{n} {pct((ow+uw)/n if n else None)}',sum(r['pending']for r in rr),sum(r['unknown']for r in rr)])
    text+='All12 saved-list versions follow. They overlap and are **not independent weekly picks**. The latest`6444834f…` list contains24 individually proved pregame records but its whole post-start membership is a rolling/reused-record diagnostic, not a fixed weekly strategy. The accepted October31`6839c7c9…` packet remains a separate24-pick version. Whole-week versus post-Thursday partial-list timing is explicit in [reporting annotations](additional-saved-versions-v2/SAVED_LIST_REPORTING_ANNOTATIONS_V1.json).\n\n'
