    text+='## Detailed right/wrong records, verification and recovery\n\n'
    text+='Private detailed rows retain player/game IDs, exact method/capture, original forecast/line/side, actual, grade and all three signed differences. All four OverWin/OverLoss/UnderWin/UnderLoss buckets remain; large numerical errors can still choose a correct side. The cause is **unresolved** without supported consumed-input evidence; no postgame explanation, offset or inversion is treated as a validated remedy. Direct models do not acquire invented opportunity components. [Safe detailed-scorecard index](checkpoint-summary-v1/RIGHT_AND_WRONG_SAFE_MANIFEST_V2.json) and [current detail version](checkpoint-summary-v1/CURRENT_DETAIL_VIEW.json) bind the private rows.\n\n'
