    text+='Recovery remains incomplete: fresh supported account/list reads find the same actual account and348approved-folder items;38required old parts /796,917,760bytes remain missing across three seasonal archives. Delta and original Krestorations stay verified. No quota figure is exposed, and no unchanged upload retry, deletion, purchase, destination/sharing change or large fitting wave occurred. New bounded grading rows and current-vintage source snapshots have local readback but no offhost-restoration claim. See [recovery census](RECOVERY_STATUS_L_V1.json); the exact missing-only restoration and new output reserve are still required before governed fits.\n\n'
