    text+='The current selectedranking pointer/file reads back with matching SHA and24saved records. The adaptive pointer’s referenced`7b80b296…` file returned404 at both the exact served URL and pinned production contents path; a pointer is not served-value verification. Latest parent41509750811 failed the source/publication handover step; enqueue and capture were skipped. Exact log cause is unverified after a403redirect; no access bypass. [Owner asset status](OWNER_CURRENT_ASSET_READBACK_V1.json) and [owner-only notice](https://github.com/NickNicky19/NFL-forecasting-V2/pull/1#issuecomment-6586942955) preserve that distinction.\n\n'
